; bombs.eval - the fire and poison bombs in their three sizes (transparency
; Phase 5).
;
; Run:  Dungeon.exe -eval tools\EvalScripts\bombs.eval
;
; A MEASUREMENT, not a pass/fail. Each size is thrown down a row of sturdy
; skeletons in the open arena; `monsters` before and after shows how far its
; blast reached and how hard it bit, and `tally` counts the blast. What a reader
; is looking for: the vial reaches fewer skeletons and bites less than the small
; bottle, and the flask more than both (throw_scale 0.6 / 1 / 1.5 over the
; blast's damage, reach and linger and the on-hit effects).

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 5

echo === fire: vial / bottle / flask ===
arena open 9 9
heal
tp 10 12
face east
spawn skel_warrior 13 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 14 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 15 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 16 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 17 12 south 50
freeze on
tally reset
throw fire_flask_small
step 6
echo --- fire_flask_small ---
monsters
tally

arena open 9 9
heal
tp 10 12
face east
spawn skel_warrior 13 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 14 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 15 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 16 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 17 12 south 50
freeze on
tally reset
throw fire_flask
step 6
echo --- fire_flask ---
monsters
tally

arena open 9 9
heal
tp 10 12
face east
spawn skel_warrior 13 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 14 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 15 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 16 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 17 12 south 50
freeze on
tally reset
throw fire_flask_large
step 6
echo --- fire_flask_large ---
monsters
tally

echo === poison: vial / bottle / flask ===
arena open 9 9
heal
tp 10 12
face east
spawn skel_warrior 13 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 14 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 15 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 16 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 17 12 south 50
freeze on
tally reset
throw poison_flask_small
step 15
echo --- poison_flask_small ---
monsters
tally

arena open 9 9
heal
tp 10 12
face east
spawn skel_warrior 13 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 14 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 15 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 16 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 17 12 south 50
freeze on
tally reset
throw poison_flask
step 15
echo --- poison_flask ---
monsters
tally

arena open 9 9
heal
tp 10 12
face east
spawn skel_warrior 13 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 14 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 15 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 16 12 south 50
spawn skel_warrior 17 12 south 50
freeze on
tally reset
throw poison_flask_large
step 15
echo --- poison_flask_large ---
monsters
tally
